{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "549c86bb-748a-82a2-8819-d656522d8e85",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T10:56:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, I think I'm calling the right place? It's about a fire hydrant that's maybe buried in snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are, I can take that. A buried hydrant, okay. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, uh, sort of in front of 366 Broadway. I think that's the number on the building anyway. Up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "366 Broadway, North End. Let me make sure I have that right, three six six Broadway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, three six six. [line breaks up] ...the plow came through, I think Saturday, maybe Sunday morning, and it pushed all of it up against the hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me for a second. The plow pushed the snow against the hydrant, is that what you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:35-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yeah. It's like totally covered. I could sort of see the top cap yesterday but now I think it's gone. And it's not even a big storm, it was just a dusting this morning on top of what was already there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And it's been cold, so nothing's melting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:57-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. It's been, like, maybe fifteen degrees at night. It's all ice now. I think it's probably a block of ice around the thing. And this is, I mean, it's not the first time the plow's done this on our street, so I'm kind of tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So it's been buried by plowing before at this spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:54:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think so, yeah. Last month, maybe twice. Nobody ever comes and digs it out, as far as I can tell. I mean, maybe somebody does, but it's always buried again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:54:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll log it now. Buried hydrant, in front of 366 Broadway, snow and ice packed in from plowing, and it's happened before at that location. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's it. I just, I sort of want it actually written down this time. Like logged, so it's on record that I called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It will be. I'm entering it as we speak. Is there a cross street you can give me, just so the crew finds the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think it's maybe closer to the corner, the one by the little market. I don't remember the name of the cross street. [pause] Sorry, I've been, I'm trying to read this chess book and my brain is, it's the library one, about openings, and I can't even think of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's alright, the house number is plenty. Chess openings, that sounds like a good winter project."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of, yeah. I'm maybe on the Italian Game. Anyway, the hydrant. Can somebody actually come out today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:55:53-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a time, but I'll mark it so the crew sees it's a safety item. Hydrants get priority over a lot of other things. Can I get a number in case they have a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's four oh one, five five five, zero one six one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one six one. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carlos Teixeira. T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Carlos Teixeira. So that's logged: buried hydrant, 366 Broadway, repeat problem, and a callback number. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. I just hope somebody actually does it this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's in the system now with your name on it. Take care, Carlos, and stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
